#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:139
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:179
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:141
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` specifies the maximum number of tokens batched in"
" a single forward pass. Adjust this parameter for throughput optimization."
msgstr "`--max-num-batched-tokens` 指定单次前向传播中批处理的最大 token 数量。调整此参数以优化吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:142
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:182
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To "
"enable it, remove this option."
msgstr "`--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。要启用它，请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:143
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:183
msgid ""
"`--mm-processor-cache-gb` sets the size of the multimodal processor cache "
"(in GB). A value of `0` disables caching."
msgstr "`--mm-processor-cache-gb` 设置多模态处理器缓存的大小（以 GB 为单位）。值为 `0` 表示禁用缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:144
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode graph compilation for improved performance."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` "
"启用全解码图编译以提升性能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional_config '{\"enable_cpu_binding\":true}'` enables CPU binding to"
" improve performance."
msgstr "`--additional_config '{\"enable_cpu_binding\":true}'` 启用 CPU 绑定以提升性能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:173
msgid "On Atlas 300I DUO:"
msgstr "在 Atlas 300I DUO 上："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:175
msgid "Only `float16` dtype is supported."
msgstr "仅支持 `float16` 数据类型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:176
msgid ""
"Graph compilation (`--compilation-config`) requires **CANN version >= "
"9.0.0**. If your CANN version is lower, please revert to eager mode by "
"replacing the `--compilation-config` argument with `--enforce-eager`."
msgstr ""
"图编译（`--compilation-config`）要求 **CANN 版本 >= 9.0.0**。如果您的 CANN 版本较低，请将 "
"`--compilation-config` 参数替换为 `--enforce-eager` 以回退到 eager 模式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:181
msgid ""
"`--max_model_len` specifies the maximum context length — that is, the sum of"
" input and output tokens for a single request."
msgstr "`--max_model_len` 指定最大上下文长度，即单个请求的输入和输出 token 之和。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:184
msgid ""
"`--dtype float16` specifies the model dtype. On Atlas 300I DUO, only "
"`float16` is supported."
msgstr "`--dtype float16` 指定模型的数据类型。在 Atlas 300I DUO 上，仅支持 `float16`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:185
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode graph compilation for improved performance. On Atlas 300I DUO, "
"`fuse_norm_quant` in graph compilation is disabled by default in "
"`--additional_config`."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` "
"启用完整解码图编译以提升性能。在 Atlas 300I DUO 上，`--additional_config` 中图编译的 "
"`fuse_norm_quant` 默认禁用。"

