#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:407
msgid "**Q: What are the deployment requirements for Atlas 300I DUO?**"
msgstr "**问：Atlas 300I DUO 的部署要求是什么？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:409
msgid ""
"A: On Atlas 300I DUO, only `float16` dtype is supported. Graph compilation "
"(`--compilation-config`) requires **CANN version >= 9.0.0**; if your CANN "
"version is lower, use `--enforce-eager` instead."
msgstr ""
"答：在 Atlas 300I DUO 上，仅支持 `float16` 数据类型。图编译 （`--compilation-config`）要求 "
"**CANN 版本 >= 9.0.0**；如果您的 CANN 版本较低，请改用 `--enforce-eager`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/PaddleOCR-VL.md:411
msgid ""
"**Q: What should I do if I encounter dependency conflicts during "
"installation on Atlas 300I DUO?**"
msgstr "**问：在 Atlas 300I DUO 上安装过程中遇到依赖冲突该怎么办？**"

